# Architecture index — derived scratch only.
# .arch/index.json, .arch/pinned-commit, .arch/INDEX.md, .arch/ARCH-EVIDENCE.md and
# .arch/ANALYSIS.md ARE committed on purpose: the index is only useful if it is
# diffable across runs and present in the clean checkout that /team ship verifies from.
.arch/DRIFT.json
.arch/tree.json
